	)
	(text "BLOCK 1: POWER SUPPLY & REVERSE POLARITY PROTECTION\n• 2x AA Alkaline Cells (1.8V to 3.2V operating range)\n• DMG2305UX P-MOSFET (0.04 Ohm Rds_on, 0 uA sleep current)\n• Decoupling: 100uF Bulk Tantalum + 10uF Ceramic + 0.1uF High-Frequency"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25 35 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "1cdd1643-5ddd-4a0b-b240-565e3338a3e4")
	)
	(text "BLOCK 2: WCH CH573F 32-BIT RISC-V BLE 5.0 SoC\n• Package: QFN-28 (4x4mm, 0.4mm pitch)\n• HSE: 32.000 MHz Crystal (+/- 10 ppm) with 2x 12pF Load Capacitors\n• LSE: 32.768 kHz RTC Crystal with 2x 12pF Load Capacitors\n• Internal Regulators: VDCID (2.2uF), VDCIA (1.0uF), VINTA (1.0uF)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25 55 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "01fcebbd-9bf1-40e2-a279-eb336a160ad4")
	)
	(text "BLOCK 3: 2.4 GHz RF FRONT-END & ANTENNA\n• 50 Ohm Pi-Matching Network (L1=1.2nH, C12=1.0pF, L2=1.5nH)\n• High-Efficiency On-Board 2.4 GHz Meandered Inverted-F Antenna (MIFA)\n• Full Ground Clearance on Top and Bottom layers under radiating arm"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25 75 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "08dcd41c-dfb2-4906-a1e6-dd546720bec4")
	)
	(text "BLOCK 4: EN 54-7 OPTICAL SMOKE DETECTION CIRCUIT\n• IR Emitter: 940nm T-1 3/4 5mm LED driven via SI2302 N-MOSFET (PA5)\n• Pulse Current: ~80mA Peak @ 15ms pulse duration, 0 uA standby sleep\n• Receiver: 5mm High-Speed Silicon Phototransistor into PA4 (AIN0)\n• Biasing: 220k Load Resistor + 100pF RF Shunt for high SNR differential detection"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25 95 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "837bd5cf-251e-4297-b8c2-a114d78eae45")
	)
	(text "BLOCK 5: HIGH-OUTPUT ACOUSTIC SIREN (>85 dBA @ 3m)\n• Piezo Transducer element (Murata PKMCS0909E / 12mm sounder)\n• SI2302 N-MOSFET driven by PA12 (2800 Hz Temporal-3 tone)\n• 22mH Step-up inductive kick coil creating 20-30V peak across piezo\n• 30V Zener clamp diode prevents breakdown spike, 0 uA sleep consumption"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25 115 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "3122746f-8aaa-4617-8d99-f35935159f61")
	)
	(text "BLOCK 6: INTERFACES, DIAGNOSTICS & USER CONTROLS\n• USB Type-C for direct PC USB-ISP flashing (PB22 BOOT mode)\n• Dedicated 4-Pin 2.54mm UART Debug Header [TX PA8, RX PA9, 3V3, GND]\n• Dedicated 4-Pin 2.54mm SWD Header [TIO PB14, TCK PB15, 3V3, GND]\n• Tactile Push-Button for Manual Self-Test / Alarm Hush (PB4)\n• Optional SHTC3 / AHT20 I2C Temperature & Humidity Sensor footprint (PA14/PA15)"
